  <p class="updated">Last Updated: November 18, 2026 | Effective Date: November 18, 2026</p>
  <p class="intro">At <b>LearnHTMLCSSJS.com</b>, your privacy is very important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you learn <b>HTML, CSS, and JavaScript</b> for free on our website. By using our website, you agree to this policy.</p>

