    <a href="#1">1. Information We Collect</a> • <a href="#2">2. How We Use Your Information</a> • <a href="#3">3. Cookies</a> • <a href="#4">4. Google Analytics & Ads</a> • <a href="#5">5. Data Security</a> • <a href="#6">6. Third-Party Links</a> • <a href="#7">7. Children's Privacy</a> • <a href="#8">8. Your Rights</a> • <a href="#9">9. Changes</a> • <a href="#10">10. Contact Us</a>
