      <li><b>Access:</b> Ask what data we have about you.</li>
      <li><b>Update:</b> Correct your name or email if it is wrong.</li>
      <li><b>Delete:</b> Request deletion of your account and all your data, including scores and progress.</li>
      <li><b>Download:</b> Ask for a copy of your data.</li>
      <li><b>Withdraw:</b> Stop using our website at any time.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:contact@learnhtmlcssjs.com">contact@learnhtmlcssjs.com</a> with subject "Data Request". We will reply within 7 days. After you delete your account, your scores will also be removed from the ranking page.</p>
  </div>

